# vue-vitest-playwright adapter manifest — the DATA fields of the Vue
# StackAdapter. Code fields (detect/install/discover/probe/run/coverage) stay in
# src/adapters/vue-vitest-playwright/index.ts; auditRules stays TS
# (vueAuditRules). Declared fields override via manifestFields. Partial by design.
# guidance + patterns are PER-KIND: unit (vitest + @vue/test-utils) differs from
# e2e (Playwright), so both blocks/pointers are declared distinctly.

adapter vue-vitest-playwright
  command typecheck = true
  command lint = true
  command test-unit = npx vitest run
  command test-e2e = npx playwright test
  command coverage = npx vitest run --coverage --coverage.reporter=json-summary
  patterns unit = vue-unit-patterns.md
  patterns e2e = vue-e2e-patterns.md
  guidance unit:
    (vitest + @vue/test-utils) placed next to source as src/<Name>.test.ts. Mount components with mount(Comp, { props }); query with wrapper.get('[aria-label="…"]'); ALWAYS await wrapper.get(...).trigger('click') before asserting. Test pure .ts helpers directly.
  guidance e2e:
    (Playwright @playwright/test) under e2e/<name>.spec.ts; page.goto('/') then drive via getByLabel/getByRole using ONLY the labels in the ground truth.
